silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_01_reader_onboarding_sections_01_what_the_encyclopedia_is_concrete_anchor_11 silm:hasExample "In '01WhatTheEncyclopediaIsConcreteAnchor11', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the bare taxonomic epithet catus (Felis catus TSN 183798); a taxonomy-source leg, not Mittens." .
